<title>USA: Gabelli group lifts Moog stake.</title>
<headline>Gabelli group lifts Moog stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Thursday it raised its stake in Moog Inc to 623,300 class A common shares or 11.5 percent of the class outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought a net of 81,500 shares between July 24 and August 18 at prices ranging from $19.05 to $22.60 a share.</p>
<p>The group holds its stake in Moog for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
